# Copy to .env (git-ignored) to override the defaults. Expo reads this file
# from the package directory; EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are inlined into
# production bundles and read at runtime in development.

# Where the OCF IMS server is. Precedence (src/config/env.ts):
#   1. this variable, when set;
#   2. web: the page's own origin (production serves the web export and the
#      Connect routes from one host);
#   3. a native development build: http://<the machine running Metro>:8090,
#      the docker dev stack;
#   4. otherwise the app refuses to start — a production native build must set it.
# The docker dev stack, reached from the iOS simulator or a browser on the same machine:
#EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8090
# A phone on the LAN, or the Android emulator (10.0.2.2 is the host), needs the
# machine's address instead:
#EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.5:8090
